  "id": "sce397:00E06",
  "jp": "フェイン「そ、そうだ。だから、別に盗み聞きをしようと{nl}　などけっして思ってはいないぞ」",
  "off": 3590,
  "len": 50,
  "en": "Fain: Y-yes, indeed. Thus we had no intention whatsoever of eavesdropping!",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 3592,
  "text_len": 47
 },
 {
  "id": "sce397:00E3B",
