  "off": 3643,
  "len": 12,
  "en": "Touya: ...",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 3645,
  "text_len": 9
 },
 {
  "id": "sce397:00E4A",
  "jp": "ガボン「‥‥すまん。俺としたことがフェインの口車に‥‥」",
  "off": 3658,
  "len": 38,
  "en": "Gabon: ...Sorry. To think I'd fall for Fain's smooth talk...",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 3660,
  "text_len": 35
 },
 {
  "id": "sce397:00E73",
